# Chromium's profile for the Whatnot scraper: runtime state, rebuilt on demand,
# and holding a live session. Default/Cookies plus Local State together are
# enough to recover the signed-in session, so this must never be committed —
# 142 of these files were, once, by an over-broad `git add -A`.
/storage/whatnot-browser-profile/
/storage/whatnot-browser-profile.broken/

# The saved session itself, in every shape it takes.
/storage/whatnot-cookies.json
/storage/whatnot-cookies.json.loaded-mtime
/storage/whatnot-live-cookies.json
/storage/whatnot-localstorage.json
